    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3023f43f57cdc10edb2f24ca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁曾一度认为，\n“想赢”的心情不过只是恼人的杂音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe2d6bf886a64f625708d4062a5cd8f5f70cd3114a0f19c03d177ce39f7a18c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1026/storytimeline_501026403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:967f9f416806d05014dc0942",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在她却觉得，放任自己去追求那样的激情\n是让她感到很“舒畅”的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e927860a2961ae2544a6252962446bec353a7efdf88f56b2bc6648188ee5cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
